# The films, series and media files the repository may name (scripts/check_media_names.py).
#
# What the owner watches is personal, and the repository is public (the owner, 2026-11-11;
# agent-failures A70). A test that needs a title takes one listed here. A new one is a name no film
# of the owner's has, never a line copied from a file listing: invented, or an old film out of
# copyright (before 1929). Adding one is a gate change: the owner's `Gate-Changed:` trailer.
#
# An entry is `<name> | <why it is needed>`. Names are matched with case, dots, underscores and
# edge punctuation set aside ("Velvet.Static" is "velvet static").

[names]
